    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bagabīji na shikolo sheela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wīlage ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe gīkī bashikūje ī shakwinha sheela īsho Baisilaeli bakūshifunyaga kūlwa nguno yane; ni bilang'hanage batizūlīsosohaja ī lina lyane īlo līlī lyeela; ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage gīkī, ‘Ūlū munhū ose ose mu bing'we ūsosohala, alīyo hū wegeela dūhū a ha shakwinha sheela īsho Baisilaeli bakūsheejaga kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, ū munhū ng'wenūyo shing'wigeleelilwe kūkomanyiwa wīnge ū kū būtongi wane. Ī shilagīlo shenīshi shilī kūlwa nguno ya shibyalīlwe shing'we shose, nī shisho shiliza. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ose ose ū wa mu lūganda lwa Alooni ūlū alī na būsaatu w'ikūnza lya mīlī, nūūlū būsaatu wa kūfung'wa būsoso mu mīlī, yaya ū kūshilya ī shakwinha ī sheela kūshisha apīle. Akūbiza nsoso nūūlū ūkuumya shikolo shose shose īsho shasosohalaga kūlwa kwikuumya na mimba, nūūlū shasosohalaga kūlwa kūkuumiwa na munhū wilooteelaga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūūlū kūlwa kūkuumya shiinū yose yose īyo īkigweesaga hasī, īyo īdūgije kūnsosohaja munhū, nūūlū wikuumya na munhū ūyo ashikile kūnsosohaja; nūūlū ūmo būlang'wizīīle ū būsoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūkuumya shikolo shisoso sha mbika yenīyo akūbiza nsoso kūshisha līīmi līlibīle. Yaya ū kūlya shose shose ū mu shakwinha ī sheela kūshisha ooge mu minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī līīmi ūlū lyūlībīla akūbalwa gīkī welaga; hūna lūūlū kwandīja ikanza lyenīlo adūgije kūshilya ī shakwinha ī sheela, nguno shilī shakūlya shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo atigeleelilwe kūlya shose shose ūlū ūshisanga shachaaga shoi dūhū, nūūlū shabūlagagwa shiinū; yaya ū kwisosohaja kūlwa nguno yasho. Ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji ībigeleelilwe kwīdima na welwang'holò pyī īyo nayīhelile, batizingīla mu kwihīga nose bache kūlwa nguno ya kūleka kwīkūja īyo nīhelile nene. Ū nene nalī SEEBA ūyo akabīītaga kūbiza beela a bagabīji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ose ose ūyo atī wa mu lūganda lwa bagabīji atazunīlījiwe ū kūshilya ī shakwinha ī sheela; nūūlū ngeni wa ha ng'wa ngabīji yaya, nūūlū ng'witūmamīja wa mheela ūyo alītūmama hoi yaya ū kūshilya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ngabīji ūlū ūgūla nsese, nūūlū nsese ūbyalīlwa ho a ha kaya, ū nsese ng'wenūyo adūgije ū kūshilya ī shilīwa sha ngabīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nshīke wa ngabīji ūlū ūtoolwa na ngosha ūyo atī ngabīji, akūbiza wīngaga ū mu būzunīlījiwa wa kūshilya ī shakwinha sheela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū nshīke wa ngabīji ūlū ūchīlwa ngoshi, nūūlū ūbūlaga numba, alīyo ūbiza atī na baana, hūna ūshoka ha ng'wa ise kwikala gīt'ūmo wikalīlaga aho ataalī kūtoolwa, ū ng'wenūyo adūgije kūshilya ī shilīwa sha ng'wa ise. Alīyo ī shilīwa shenīsho shitī sha kūlyiwa na ose ose ūyo atazunīlīgije kūshilya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūūlū munhū ūhūbīla ūshilya ī shakwinha sheela, akūshilīpa īsho walyaga, ongeja n'īmò ya itanò yasho; ūtwala kūlī ngabīji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A bagabīji ītabigeleelilwe kūshisosohaja ī shakwinha sheela īsho Baisilaeli bakafunyaga kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūyūbazunīlīja kūshilya ī shakwinha sheela shenīsho hanuma kwingīla mu makoye ga kūlīpa. Ū nene nalī SEEBA, hū nene nakabīītaga a banhū kūbiza beela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mitugo ījo jilemilwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wīlage ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe, hamò na a Baisilaeli a bose gīkī, ‘Ose ose ū mu bing'we, abize ng'wana byalwa wa mu Isilaeli, nūūlū ngeni ūyo akwikalaga mu Isilaeli, ūlū wenha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA shakwinha shakwe sha kūpemva kūlwa nguno ya mhayo ūyo wilahīla kūgūshikīlīja, nūūlū shakwinha sha wiyaabī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha shenīsho shiigelile ībize ng'ombe, nūūlū ng'holo nūūlū mbūli; hama ībize ng'osha ītī na būka, h'īkwanukūlwa kūlwa nguno yakwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwenha shose shose īsho shilī na buka, nguno shitanukūlwa kūlwako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ose ose wenha kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA ng'ombe nūūlū ng'holo nūūlū mbūli kūlwa shakwinha sha būsangī, īkī atogilwe kūshikīlīja mhayo ūyo wilahīla kūgwīta, nūūlū kūfunya shakwinha sha wiyaabī, shiigelile ū ntugo gwenūyo gūbize gūtī na būka nūūlū būlemehazu bose bose, hū shikwanukūlwa ī shakwinha shenīho kūlwa nguno yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūmfunīja ū SEEBA īyo ībbokulile, nūūlū īlemehalile, nūūlū ībīnzīkile hanhū, nūūlū īlī na madindili, nūūlū būhele, nūūlū īchūūbagūkile. Ī ya gīko ūtizīfunya nūūlū hado a ha ng'walīlo gīkī ībize shakwinha sha kūbeegejiwa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe nūūlū ī ng'holo īyo īlemehalile ūdūgije ū kwīfunya gītī shakwinha sha wiyaabī, alīyo ūlū kūshikīlīja mhayo ūyo wisagīja kūgwīta, ū ntugo gwa gīko gūtīko ū kwanukūlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ntugo gūsoloolilwe yaya ū kūmfunīja ū SEEBA; ū mhayo gwenūyo yaya gete ū kūgwīta ū mu sī ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū kūfuma ū kū bageni yaya ū kwanukūla ntugo gūlī gīko kūlwa kūgūfunya kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu wako kūbiza shakūlya. Ī ja gīko jitanukūlwa nguno jilemehalile, na jiminije.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
