        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ūfunya shitambò sha kūnūmba SEEBA, shifunyage mu mbika īyo shikwanukūlwa kūlwa nguno yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyama yenīyo shiigelile īlyiwe lūshikū lwenūlo dūhū; yaya kwīsaaja nūūlū hado kūshisha ntondo yaho. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shidimagi ī shilagīlo shane, nīyo mushilondeele gete. Ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya kūlīsosohaja ī lina lyane ī lyeela; a Baisilaeli baniitegeleje gīkī nalī ng'wela. Ū nene nalī SEEBA ūyo akang'wejaga a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū nene nakang'wīnja na mu sī ya Misili gīkī nabize Mulungu wing'we. Ū nene nalī SEEBA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
